WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 1, Scene 32h: Battle of the Gardens — exterior to ground combat
Duration: ~22 seconds
Source: FF8 FMV

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Close-up of Balamb Garden's damaged hull, blue emblem visible, dents and gashes.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Camera pulls away into blue sky, then drops to aerial view of green forest below.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
View from beneath the tangled Gardens, green plain and mountains beyond.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Inside Garden's courtyard, SeeD cadets and Galbadian soldiers clash in a massive melee. Fire and debris.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.800
Wide overhead shot. Dozens fight across the pink-tiled courtyard, cyan magic erupts, bodies fall.
